        "hero_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Moka started in Switzerland, with founders who kept hitting the same wall as parents: the bottles that calmed gassy feeds were a chore to clean, and even the safe ones still held warm milk against plastic.</p><p>They wanted one bottle you could trust without a second thought: glass where the milk sits, fewer parts to fail, and materials tested to a standard they'd accept for their own kids. That's the whole point of Moka.</p>",
